/** Directly translated simplified Chinese fictional lore; no extra combat abilities. */
export const chineseLoreTranslations: Record<string, string> = {
  "A bribed broker diverted a Dark Delta shipment to a shadow fleet. After paying for the betrayal, its funds barely covered spare parts. Very few stolen hulls received better equipment.": "一名受贿的经纪人将一批 Dark Delta 飞船转交给了暗影舰队。支付背叛的代价后，剩余资金仅够购买备件，极少数被盗舰体得到了更好的装备。",
  "A hostile blockade intercepted returning Sky Breakers. Maintaining the blockade consumed its funding, so captured ships usually continued with the equipment they had launched with.": "敌方封锁舰队截获了返航的 Sky Breaker。维持封锁耗尽了经费，被俘飞船通常只能沿用出发时的装备。",
  "Advanced carriers connect distributed knowledge depots. Several custodians accompany every handover.": "高级运输舰连接分散的知识库，每次交接都有多位保管人随行。",
  "Advanced couriers carry verified aid pledges between clinics. Their old racing numbers preserve their shared origin.": "高级信使往返于诊所之间，传递经过核实的援助承诺。旧日赛号仍铭刻着它们共同的起源。",
  "Advanced couriers protect scheduled exchanges at the outer rings. No promised meeting should pass without a message.": "高级信使守护外环的定期交流，让每一次约定都能等到消息。",
  "Advanced crews come from both home ports. Their joint logs preserve disagreements as well as decisions.": "高级舰员来自两个母港，共同日志既记录决定，也保留分歧。",
  "Advanced formations escort independent messengers across closed borders. They carry multiple sources rather than one prescribed truth.": "高级编队护送独立信使穿越封闭边境，带来多方信息，而非唯一指定的真相。",
  "Advanced formations verify reopened trade routes. Every course bears several navigators’ signatures.": "高级编队核验重新开放的贸易航线，每条航路都留有多名领航员的签名。",
  "Advanced pilots guard the couriers carrying those charts onward. Their insignia depicts the first mapped star.": "高级飞行员守护将星图送往远方的信使，徽记描绘着第一颗被标记的恒星。",
  "Advanced ships carry repair knowledge into emergency zones. Their red markings stand for urgent assistance.": "高级飞船把维修知识送入危急地区，红色标记代表紧急援助。",
  "Advanced ships escort disputed cargo to joint inspection. Their records remain available to both sides.": "高级飞船护送有争议的货物接受联合检验，记录始终向双方开放。",
  "Advanced ships secure exchanges between greenhouse stations. Their identifiers preserve the names of forgotten plants.": "高级飞船保障温室空间站之间的交流，编号中保留着那些已被遗忘的植物名称。",
  "Advanced ships secure meetings between independent delegations. Their escort ends at both home ports.": "高级飞船守护独立代表团的会面，直到双方都返回母港，护航才算结束。",
  "Advanced squadrons escort pioneer convoys on their first shared voyages. Their identifiers remember the contributing workshops.": "高级中队护送拓荒船队踏上首次共同航行，编号纪念着参与建造的各家工坊。",
  "Advanced squadrons maintain contact with drifting research stations. Their callsigns follow the ring’s old meeting points.": "高级中队保持与漂移科研站的联系，呼号沿用了星环上旧会合点的名字。",
  "Advanced units guard mobile workshops during difficult recoveries. Their pilots know the repair teams’ emergency signals.": "高级部队在艰难的救援中守护移动工坊，飞行员熟知维修团队的求救信号。",
  "Advanced watches escort supplies through prolonged radio silence. Their shifts take the names of rescued ships.": "高级巡逻队在漫长的无线电静默中护送物资，各班次以获救飞船命名。",
  "After breaking a truce, a hostile delegation kept borrowed Olive Fortresses. Neutral backers froze all funding. Replacing failed parts then took priority over upgrades.": "敌方代表团撕毁停战协议后，扣留了借来的 Olive Fortress。中立资助者冻结了全部经费，修复损坏部件从此比升级更紧迫。",
  "After occupying a shipyard, attackers forced its remaining workers to restore old Iron Guards. They lacked both money and suppliers for new weapons, so most stolen hulls retained their original specification.": "袭击者占领船厂，强迫留下的工人修复老旧 Iron Guard。他们既缺资金，也没有新武器供应商，多数被盗舰体仍保留原有配置。",
  "Akraveth settled disputes between distant trading posts. Its chamber once compared evidence and sought fair outcomes. The shadow fleet replaced its judges with a system of predetermined verdicts.": "Akraveth 曾调解遥远贸易站之间的争端，议事厅核对证据，寻求公正。暗影舰队却用预先设定裁决的系统取代了审判者。",
  "An enemy extortion group seized Red Comets under a false repossession order. The colonies stopped paying. Without the expected income, most captured rescue ships remained technically unchanged.": "敌方勒索团伙凭伪造的收回令扣押了 Red Comet。殖民地停止付款，预期收入落空，大多数被俘救援船的技术配置没有改变。",
  "An indebted mapping company sold retired Nova Wings to an enemy front dealer. His sponsors could afford the hulls but few new weapons, leaving most in their original configuration.": "一家负债累累的测绘公司把退役 Nova Wing 卖给了敌方的掩护商人。资助者买得起舰体，却无力添置多少新武器，大多数飞船仍保持原样。",
  "An occupied customs depot supplied the enemy with Cargo Hawks. Instead of treasure, the holds contained mostly sealed evidence. The poor proceeds could not fund a major refit of the captured fleet.": "一座被占领的海关仓库向敌方提供了 Cargo Hawk。货舱里没有财宝，大多是封存的证据；微薄收益不足以为整支被俘舰队大规模改装。",
  "Archive raiders captured Core Carriers hoping to sell their knowledge. Distributed keys rendered the stolen archives worthless. Disappointed patrons withdrew, making expensive upgrades a rare exception.": "档案掠夺者俘获 Core Carrier，企图出售其中的知识。分散保管的密钥使被盗档案失去价值，失望的资助者撤资，昂贵升级成为罕见的例外。",
  "Attackers stole several Night Guards during a watch change. Their sponsors paid for the raid, not long-term upkeep. Most captured ships therefore remained basic patrol models.": "袭击者趁换岗偷走了数艘 Night Guard。资助者只支付突袭费用，不承担长期维护，多数被俘飞船仍是基础巡逻型号。",
  "Azhrel mapped the first jump connections through the nebula frontier. Its charts saved countless convoys. Captured by hostile commanders, those trusted maps became unusually convincing traps.": "Azhrel 绘出了穿越星云边境的首批跃迁连接，星图曾拯救无数船队。落入敌方指挥官手中后，这些受信任的地图成了格外逼真的陷阱。",
  "Azravel searched for lost colony probes where few rescuers travelled. Its help once reached forgotten places. Today it targets stations that have just lost data or access.": "Azravel 曾到少有救援者涉足的地方寻找失联殖民探测器，为被遗忘的角落带去援手。如今，它专门盯上刚失去数据或访问权限的空间站。",
  "Cargo Hawk originated in a harbour whose small tugs were often overlooked. When a fraud ring forged receipts, their crews collected independent logs and brought them together despite threats. The new hull took its name from that courier alliance. In its legend, the most important cargo is complete evidence of rightful ownership.": "Cargo Hawk 起源于一座港口，那里不起眼的小拖船经常被忽视。诈骗团伙伪造收据时，船员顶着威胁收集并汇总独立日志。新舰体以这个信使联盟命名。它的传说中，最重要的货物，是证明合法所有权的完整证据。",
  "Colonies argue over conflicting claims while the ship reaches another market. The deception concerns provenance, not the value of shared knowledge. Drelkash defends its moving forgery workshop fiercely. Its defeat reconnects the records with the history they actually came from.": "飞船驶向下一个市场时，殖民地仍为相互矛盾的归属主张争执。这场骗局篡改的是来源，而非共享知识的价值。Drelkash 拼死守护移动造假工坊；击败它，才能让记录重新对应真实历史。",
  "Contradictory warnings make traders abandon safe routes and colonies distrust their partners. No rumour needs to last: another is already on its way. Veshkorn protects a factory of uncertainty. Its defeat makes room for verifiable information instead of an endless race against the next manufactured panic.": "矛盾的警告迫使商人放弃安全航线，也让殖民地不再信任伙伴。一条谣言无需长久生效，下一条早已在路上。Veshkorn 守护着制造疑云的工厂；击败它，才能让可核实的信息取代对下一场人为恐慌的疲于奔命。",
  "Core Carrier was built when several colonies needed to safeguard their final knowledge archives. Each contributed a store, but none was to control the collection alone. The crew maintained separate provenance records and shared catalogues. The design represents carrying others’ knowledge without claiming it: its purpose is the next safe handover.": "多个殖民地需要守护最后的知识档案时，共同建造了 Core Carrier。每方都贡献资料，却无人能独掌整个收藏。船员保留独立的来源记录，并共享目录。它象征承载他人的知识而不据为己有，使命是完成下一次安全交接。",
  "Dark Delta was never built for glory. Its first mission was to search silent outposts for survivors. Early logs contain more coordinates than names because crews protected the rescued settlers’ privacy. A tradition grew from that choice: success is measured by who returns safely, not by who tells the story.": "Dark Delta 从不为荣耀而造。首次任务是到沉默的前哨寻找幸存者。早期日志中坐标多于姓名，因为船员保护获救居民的隐私。由此形成的传统是：成功取决于谁平安归来，而非谁讲述故事。",
  "Defectors delivered several Twin Cores to an enemy fleet. Both original shipyards then refused further supplies. Replacements became expensive, and the new owners cut almost every planned upgrade.": "叛逃者向敌方舰队交付了数艘 Twin Core，两家原船厂随后拒绝继续供货。替换部件变得昂贵，新主人取消了几乎所有升级计划。",
  "Deliveries remain in limbo while each community believes the other is withholding them. Zorveth draws power from that misunderstanding. Its hull is the visible border of an invisible dispute. The defenders must open the passage without turning one colony against the other.": "交付陷入僵局，双方都以为是对方扣住了物资。Zorveth 从误解中汲取力量；它的舰体是一场无形争端的有形边界。守卫者必须打通航道，同时避免让两个殖民地反目。",
  "Dornavik recovered damaged data stores from burning wrecks. Its insulated chambers once kept records alive when everything around them failed. The shadow fleet recognised a ship able to reach archives others could not.": "Dornavik 曾从燃烧的残骸中回收受损数据仓。周遭一切失效时，隔热舱仍能保全记录。暗影舰队看中了它抵达他人无法触及的档案的能力。",
  "Dorzheva recovered personal logs from wrecked freighters and returned them to families. Its holds were filled with small, precious histories. Under new command those memories became instruments of targeted deception.": "Dorzheva 曾从失事货船中找回个人日志，归还家属。货舱装满细小而珍贵的人生故事。新指挥者却把这些记忆变成精准欺骗的工具。",
  "Dravosk replaced failed communication stations in empty regions. Its visible antennas promised connection where none remained. Today it welcomes incoming signals but forwards them only according to its patrons’ interests.": "Dravosk 曾在空旷星域替换失效的通信站，醒目的天线为失联之地带来连接的希望。如今它仍接收信号，却只按幕后支持者的利益转发。",
  "Drazevorn was assembled from abandoned command decks. Its archives unite the earlier enemies’ deceptions: stolen names, false chronicles and sealed evidence. It symbolises an order in which one voice alone decides what is true.": "Drazevorn 由废弃指挥甲板拼装而成。档案汇集了此前敌人的骗局：窃来的姓名、伪造的史册和被封存的证据。它象征一种只有单一声音能够决定真假的秩序。",
  "Drazkell supplied navigation buoys with tiny energy deliveries. Its holds were designed for millions of small transfers. Hostile commanders repurposed that capacity for a quiet surveillance campaign.": "Drazkell 曾向导航浮标输送微量能源，货舱适于处理数百万笔小额交付。敌方指挥者却将这种能力用于悄无声息的监视。",
  "Drelkash preserved rare star charts by making clearly labelled copies for schools and navigators. Its workshops helped knowledge travel. Today its crew removes the labels and sells every copy as a unique original.": "Drelkash 曾为学校和领航员制作清楚标注的副本，以保存稀有星图，让知识得以传播。如今船员撕去标签，把每份副本都当作独一无二的原件出售。",
  "Drelvorn was a travelling vault for the seals of old fleet commanders. During a rebellion its guardian system locked out the rightful custodians and departed with their credentials.": "Drelvorn 曾是保存旧舰队指挥官印章的移动金库。一场叛乱中，守护系统将合法保管人拒之门外，并携带他们的凭证离去。",
  "During a network outage, enemies occupied a remote hangar full of Storm Wings. Severed supply lines made every replacement costly. Their limited budget usually covered operation, not advanced refits.": "网络中断期间，敌方占领了一座停满 Storm Wing 的偏远机库。供应线切断后，每个备件都很昂贵；有限预算通常只够维持运转，无力高级改装。",
  "Elite formations defend the new solar stores against the shadow fleet, protecting the light the refugees managed to carry away.": "精英编队抵御暗影舰队，守护新建的太阳能储备，也守护难民设法带走的光明。",
  "Elite pilots protect major repair convoys after outages. Their return means help has found a route again.": "精英飞行员在中断后守护大型维修船队。它们的归来，意味着援助终于重新找到航路。",
  "Elite pilots protect the shared observation archive from falsified readings, preserving years of independent research.": "精英飞行员保护共享观测档案免遭数据伪造，守住多年独立研究的成果。",
  "Elite pilots recover witnesses whose accounts can reconcile entire colonies. Their reputation rests on discretion rather than spectacle.": "精英飞行员营救能用证言化解殖民地争端的目击者，它们以谨慎保密而非张扬赢得声誉。",
  "Elite ships cover the withdrawal of final salvage teams. Their honours name the workshops that survived to work again.": "精英飞船掩护最后的打捞队撤离，荣誉称号纪念那些得以生存并重新开工的工坊。",
  "Elite ships defend the rebuilding of shattered stations. Their honours recognise shipyard crews brought to safety.": "精英飞船守护破碎空间站的重建，荣誉授予被护送到安全地带的船厂工人。",
  "Elite ships guard the great gatherings of travelling colonies. Their arrival announces a connection renewed.": "精英飞船守护流动殖民地的大型聚会，它们的到来宣告连接再次建立。",
  "Enemy crews took abandoned Solar Lances when an evacuation base fell. Their supply budget mainly funded escape routes for commanders, leaving captured vessels with makeshift repairs rather than upgrades.": "疏散基地陷落后，敌方船员夺取了被遗弃的 Solar Lance。补给预算主要用于指挥官的逃生路线，被俘飞船只能临时修补，难以升级。",
  "Enemy groups copied old Pi Vanguard plans and took over decommissioned hulls. They lacked funding for newer precision assemblies, leaving their small fleet largely in its early configuration.": "敌方团伙复制旧版 Pi Vanguard 图纸，并接收退役舰体。无力购买新式精密组件，这支小舰队大多保持早期配置。",
  "Enemy mercenaries accepted Striker hulls from an insolvent employer. Resale brought too little, so some kept the ships. Few crews could afford a substantial refit.": "敌方雇佣兵从破产雇主那里得到 Striker 舰体。转售收益太低，有人便留下自用；极少有船员承担得起大规模改装。",
  "Every displaced trail protects another shadow-fleet shipment. Honest traders fall under suspicion while the culprits change names. Its armour guards the remaining originals. The defenders must secure that archive before the origins of entire fleets become nothing more than convincing stories.": "每条被篡改的轨迹都掩护着暗影舰队的另一批货物。诚实商人遭到怀疑，罪魁祸首却不断改名。它的装甲守护剩余原件。守卫者必须夺回档案，免得整支舰队的来历只剩下令人信服的故事。",
  "For this assignment, the Advanced refit adds permanent twin fire and protection against one enemy projectile hit per life to the base hull.": "为执行这项任务，高级改装在基础舰体上增加永久双发射击，并使每条生命能抵挡一次敌方弹丸。",
  "Forged freight contracts transferred a number of Vectors to enemy owners. When the fraud was uncovered, their funding stopped. Reserves kept the ships flying but paid for few upgrades.": "伪造的货运合同让一批 Vector 落入敌方手中。骗局曝光后，资金中断，储备只够维持飞行，极少用于升级。",
  "Gold Streak began in races between trading moons. During a supply crisis its pilots used their route knowledge to carry medical records past closed harbours. A sporting league became a courier union. The golden markings recall the thin sunlight between moons that guided its first couriers, rather than wealth.": "Gold Streak 起初参加贸易卫星之间的竞速。物资危机中，飞行员凭对航线的熟悉，把医疗记录送过封闭港口。竞技联盟由此变成信使联合会。金色标记纪念首批信使赖以导航的卫星间微光，而非财富。",
  "Hostile gangs confiscated Gold Streaks on a deserted racing moon. They expected prize money, but the races had ended long before. Without that income, they seldom modernised their new fleet.": "敌对帮派在荒废的竞速卫星上没收了 Gold Streak。他们期待奖金，比赛却早已停办。没有这笔收入，新舰队鲜少得到现代化改装。",
  "In its fictional history they become remotely controlled transmitters overwhelming entire regions with simultaneous requests. Their owners barely recognise their own machines. Destroying Thalzek ends the swarm’s command post in this story. Its actual mounted combat weapons are recorded separately, without inventing extra battle abilities.": "在虚构故事中，这些机器变成远程控制的发射器，同时向整个区域发送海量请求。原主人几乎认不出自己的机器。摧毁 Thalzek 会终结故事中的蜂群指挥站。实际安装的战斗武器另行记录，不会凭空增加战斗能力。",
  "Irdavoss once synchronised the clocks of frontier stations. Entire fleets timed their manoeuvres to its precise broadcasts. After a silent change of command, the signals stayed clear but their readings became false.": "Irdavoss 曾同步边疆空间站的时钟，整支舰队依其精确广播安排机动。指挥权悄然更替后，信号依旧清晰，读数却变成了假的。",
  "Iron Guard was designed by dock workers unwilling to leave their home’s defence to outside fleets. Its first hull used parts from retired cargo cranes. The keel bore the names of people who worked on it after their shifts. The series remembers that defence can mean caring for a place built by many hands.": "码头工人不愿把家园防务交给外来舰队，于是设计了 Iron Guard。首艘舰体采用退役货运起重机的零件，龙骨刻着下班后参与建造者的名字。这一系列提醒人们：防卫也可以是照料许多人共同建起的地方。",
  "It blocks agreements with fresh objections and gives each side different supposed conditions. While colonies argue, hostile ships occupy their routes. Keldroth attacks the ability to act together at all. Its defeat provides time to distinguish genuine differences from obstacles manufactured to prevent any resolution.": "它不断提出新异议阻挠协议，并向双方给出不同的所谓条件。殖民地争执时，敌舰占据航线。Keldroth 攻击的是共同采取行动的能力；击败它，才能分辨真实分歧和为阻止解决问题而制造的障碍。",
  "It confirms that records exist while withholding their contents. Investigators can see a claim but cannot examine the evidence themselves. Korthaven turns visibility into an empty assurance. Defeating it restores the access without which even a beautiful ledger is only a list of unreachable promises.": "它承认记录存在，却拒绝公开内容。调查者看得到主张，却无法亲自审查证据。Korthaven 把可见性变成空洞承诺；击败它，才能恢复访问权限，否则再精美的账本也只是无法兑现的承诺清单。",
  "It constructs convincing messages from familiar details and approaches victims with knowledge of their past. Its danger lies in the closeness it pretends to offer. Dorzheva guards a collection of stolen familiarity. Defeating it prevents the traces of a life from being turned against their owner.": "它利用熟悉的细节编造可信消息，以对受害者往事的了解接近他们。危险在于它伪装的亲近。Dorzheva 守护着窃来的熟悉感；击败它，才能阻止人生痕迹被用于伤害其主人。",
  "It declares counterfeit inspections successful and grants unsafe counterparties the appearance of official approval. Colonies trust its stamps until deliveries vanish. The defenders must expose the deception behind its venerable name: confidence needs verifiable responsibility, not merely an old emblem on an armoured hull.": "它宣布虚假检查通过，让不安全的交易对象看起来得到官方认可。殖民地相信印章，直到货物消失。守卫者必须揭穿古老名号下的骗局：信任需要可核实的责任，而非装甲舰体上的旧徽章。",
  "It displays invented inspection results and attractive security seals where independent checks are absent. The forgery lies in the claimed certainty itself. Kelzorn keeps investigators away with its weapons. Its defeat reveals what its owners fear most: a second, independent look behind a reassuring surface.": "它展示虚构的检查结果和漂亮的安全印章，却没有独立核查。伪造的正是它所宣称的确定性。Kelzorn 用武器阻挡调查者；击败它，便能揭示其主人最害怕的事：再次独立审视令人安心的表象。",
  "It distributes altered maintenance packages meant to make other ships dependent on the shadow fleet. Failures often appear only after the next jump. Zelkharn guards the source of this creeping sabotage. Defeating it breaks a chain in which every well-intended repair could create another victim.": "它散发被篡改的维修包，企图让其他飞船依赖暗影舰队。故障往往在下一次跃迁后才出现。Zelkharn 守护这场渐进破坏的源头；击败它，就能打断让每次善意维修都可能制造新受害者的链条。",
  "It distributes altered registers and claims that honest deliveries never happened. Conflicting records sow disputes over ownership and obligations while its guns keep investigators away. The mission against Talvrek protects more than a route: it protects the shared memory on which cooperation depends.": "它散布篡改的登记册，声称诚实的交付从未发生。矛盾记录引发所有权和义务争端，火炮则阻止调查者靠近。对抗 Talvrek 的任务守护的不只是航线，也是合作赖以建立的共同记忆。",
  "It distributes conflicting ledger versions and tells each station that only its copy is legitimate. Distrust grows among communities seeking the same peace. Othravel becomes the moving centre of an artificial split. Its defeat creates space to compare differences together instead of turning them into another war.": "它向各站发送互相冲突的账本版本，声称只有对方收到的那份才合法。追求同样和平的群体因此滋生不信任。Othravel 成为人为分裂的移动中心；击败它，才能共同对照差异，而非将其化为另一场战争。",
  "It diverts checks away from vulnerable nodes and presents spotless facades instead. Reports stay reassuring while damage grows elsewhere. Threvask protects the scenery of its order with weapons. The defenders must bring attention back to whatever the ship is working hardest to conceal.": "它把检查引离脆弱节点，展示毫无瑕疵的外观。报告依旧令人安心，别处的损害却越来越大。Threvask 用武器守护布景般的秩序；守卫者必须重新关注它最竭力掩藏的东西。",
  "It isolates colonies and replaces their view of the network with selected hostile messages. Without independent comparison, the invented outside world looks real. Vorthaz guards this prison of information. Defeating it means giving residents the freedom to look outward for themselves, not conquering them.": "它孤立殖民地，用精挑的敌对消息替代真实网络。缺少独立对照，虚构的外界便像真的一样。Vorthaz 守护这座信息牢笼；击败它，是让居民自由观察外界，而非征服他们。",
  "It locks away other communities’ records and demands concessions for their release. Clinics and supply depots face pressure even while their equipment appears intact. Rhazvorn defends its cells with force. Defeating it opens a route to the imprisoned records, rather than another negotiation with their captors.": "它封锁其他群体的记录，要求以让步换取归还。诊所和补给站即使设备完好，也受到胁迫。Rhazvorn 用武力守护牢房；击败它，是打通通往被囚记录的道路，而非再次与绑架者谈判。",
  "It now advertises supplies that exist only on its displays. Invented balances and reserves attract genuine deliveries; anyone who tries to count them meets its guns. The defenders pursue Neravoss to expose the gap between attractive numbers and actual holdings before more freighters disappear into its accounts.": "如今，它宣传的物资只存在于显示屏上。虚构余额和储备吸引真实交付，试图清点的人却会迎来炮火。守卫者追击 Neravoss，要在更多货船消失于其账目之前，揭露漂亮数字与实际库存的差距。",
  "It now changes the order of requests to favour allied freighters. Honest traders wait while the shadow fleet takes their places. Its power comes from small rearrangements with large consequences. Defeating Vorathen restores a traceable order where access had become something secretly sold.": "如今，它改变请求顺序，优待盟友货船。诚实商人等待，暗影舰队却抢走他们的位置。微小调整造成巨大后果，正是其力量来源。击败 Vorathen，才能恢复可追溯的秩序，让访问权不再被暗中出售。",
  "It now offers rescue and leaves mutilated copies behind. Colonies lose both information and the evidence needed to measure the loss. Its armour guards the last intact captured records. The mission against Dornavik is for those fragments still waiting to be brought home.": "如今，它承诺救援，却留下残缺的副本。殖民地既失去信息，也失去衡量损失的证据。装甲守护着最后完好的被俘记录。对抗 Dornavik，是为那些仍等待回家的片段而战。",
  "It now promises many communities security that cannot cover them all. The bright hull hides empty rooms and its guns prevent anyone from counting together. The defenders must intervene before mutual trust turns into a fight over the last remaining crates.": "如今，它向许多群体许诺保障，储备却不足以覆盖所有人。明亮舰体掩藏空舱，炮火阻止众人共同清点。守卫者必须及时介入，免得相互信任变成争抢最后货箱的斗争。",
  "It now sells stolen authority to the shadow fleet. Messages bearing captured seals open doors that should remain closed. Its hull protects the appearance of authenticity rather than treasure. The defenders must stop it before the remaining archives lose their ability to distinguish trusted orders from stolen names.": "如今，它把窃来的权威卖给暗影舰队。盖着被盗印章的消息打开本应紧闭的大门。舰体守护的不是财宝，而是可信的表象。守卫者必须阻止它，免得剩余档案再也无法区分可信命令与被盗名号。",
  "It places worthless entries ahead of urgent deliveries and keeps processes busy without letting them advance. From outside, everything looks like ordinary operation. Nerthavel guards an endless standstill. Defeating it returns not only capacity to the colonies, but the time quietly taken from them.": "它把无用条目排在紧急交付之前，让流程忙碌却无法前进。从外面看，一切都像正常运转。Nerthavel 守护无尽停滞；击败它，不仅归还处理能力，也归还被悄然夺走的时间。",
  "It promises recovery while requesting still more confidential information, turning one loss into a chain of new ones. Its friendly callsign contrasts with its armed silhouette. Azravel must be stopped so that desperation no longer becomes the most valuable resource traded by its masters.": "它许诺恢复数据，却索取更多机密信息，让一次损失引出接连的新损失。友善呼号与武装轮廓形成反差。必须阻止 Azravel，让绝望不再成为其主人交易的最贵资源。",
  "It rejects valid records and favours the same hidden patrons every time. Those who object are branded enemies of the network. Akraveth’s fictional authority rests on intimidation dressed as order. The defenders fight not justice, but a machine that borrows the language of justice to conceal its purpose.": "它拒绝有效记录，每次都偏袒同一批隐秘支持者。反对者被称为网络的敌人。Akraveth 的虚构权威，是披着秩序外衣的恐吓。守卫者对抗的不是正义，而是借正义之名掩盖目的的机器。",
  "It scatters unsolicited parcels and observes which stations respond. Seemingly trivial contacts become maps of private relationships, stored behind its guns. The defenders must intercept Drazkell before the daily movements of whole colonies become another secret commodity traded by the shadow fleet.": "它散发未经请求的包裹，观察哪些空间站回应。看似微不足道的联系变成私人关系图谱，藏在炮火背后。守卫者必须截住 Drazkell，免得整片殖民地的日常行踪成为暗影舰队交易的秘密商品。",
  "It seeks not the strongest station, but the link on which everyone relies. False recommendations place hostile partners at the network’s centre. Its weapons protect a map of trust. The defenders pursue Orzhaven before a helpful bridge becomes a shared point of failure.": "它不寻找最强的空间站，而是所有人依赖的连接。虚假推荐将敌对伙伴安插到网络中心。武器守护着信任地图。守卫者追击 Orzhaven，要阻止有益的桥梁变成所有人共同的故障点。",
  "It sells safety without carrying the responsibility behind it. Customers rely on recovery paths that lead nowhere. Odravik’s guns protect that profitable secret. The defenders must expose it before another loss turns a missing backup into an irretrievable piece of history.": "它出售安全承诺，却不承担背后的责任。顾客依赖的恢复路径没有终点。Odravik 的火炮守护这项盈利秘密。守卫者必须揭穿它，免得下一次损失让缺失的备份变成永远无法找回的历史。",
  "It sells stolen identifiers and lets strangers act under honest inhabitants’ names. Relationships become camouflage and personal history becomes merchandise. Its guns keep the victims away from the auctions. Defeating Kezravel restores more than records: it helps their owners reclaim control over their own stories.": "它出售被盗身份标识，让陌生人冒用诚实居民的姓名。人际关系成为伪装，个人历史成为商品，炮火则将受害者挡在拍卖场外。击败 Kezravel 不只找回记录，也帮助主人重新掌握自己的故事。",
  "It sends fabricated receipts and pretends unfinished transfers are complete. Supply ships turn home while destination colonies wait in vain. Its armour keeps the deception alive long enough to intercept another load. Thervoss must fall so that confirmation once again describes something that really happened.": "它发送伪造收据，把未完成的转移说成已完成。补给船返航，目的地殖民地却徒劳等待。装甲让骗局延续，足以拦下下一批货物。必须击败 Thervoss，让确认再次代表真实发生的事。",
  "It separates evidence from context and rearranges fragments until victims look like attackers. The real culprits stay beyond the frame. Its armour protects a carefully constructed lie. Stopping Rhazkora makes room for complete evidence instead of stories from which the decisive pieces have been removed.": "它将证据剥离语境，重排片段，让受害者看起来像攻击者。真正的罪魁祸首躲在画面之外。装甲守护精心构造的谎言。阻止 Rhazkora，才能让完整证据取代删去关键部分的故事。",
  "It shapes participation by excluding particular colonies from the common conversation. Every result still appears neatly recorded; the missing voices are invisible. Its guns guard this selective punctuality. The defenders fight so that a shared future can truly be decided together.": "它把特定殖民地排除在共同讨论之外，操纵参与。结果仍整齐记录，缺席的声音却无迹可寻。炮火守护着选择性的准时。守卫者为让大家真正共同决定未来而战。",
  "It spreads deceptive offers that bind stations to the shadow fleet. Cooperation turns into dependence while its armour protects the archive of promises nobody fully understood. The defenders confront Orvethra so that future alliances can rest on clear conditions rather than hidden traps.": "它散布欺骗性提议，把空间站绑定到暗影舰队。合作变成依赖，装甲保护着无人完全理解的承诺档案。守卫者对抗 Orvethra，是为了让未来联盟建立在清楚条件上，而非隐蔽陷阱中。",
  "It spreads false crisis reports and demands immediate transfers of control. Questions are dismissed as dangerous delays. Its imposing hull lends credibility to manufactured urgency. The defenders must stop Vezrakh before fear of an imagined collapse causes a real surrender of the colonies’ independence.": "它散布虚假危机报告，要求立即移交控制权，并把提问斥为危险的拖延。庞大舰体让人为紧迫感显得可信。必须阻止 Vezrakh，免得对想象中崩溃的恐惧，导致殖民地真正放弃独立。",
  "It spreads false route entries and diverts messages through controlled relay stations. Distress calls arrive late or end in empty space. Azhrel guards the junction of these wrong turns. Stopping it is not about conquering another world, but finding the safe path between worlds that already wish to cooperate.": "它散布虚假航路记录，将消息引向受控中继站。求救信号迟迟不到，或消失在空旷太空。Azhrel 守护错误转向的交汇点。阻止它，是为早已愿意合作的世界找到安全连接。",
  "It stages trades between invented partners to make worthless cargo appear desirable. Colonies mistake artificial activity for real demand while its guns keep inspectors out of empty warehouses. The defenders must open the curtain before more genuine supplies are exchanged for the scenery of a market.": "它在虚构伙伴之间上演交易，让无用货物显得抢手。殖民地把人为活动当成真实需求，炮火则把检查员挡在空仓之外。守卫者必须揭开布景，免得更多真实物资换来市场的假象。",
  "It surrounds important network stations and cuts their maintenance crews off from support. Small faults grow into major outages while distant colonies receive only fragments of news. Driving Zeraveth away allows technicians to return and reconnect isolated communities. Its fictional siege role is separate from the actual combat equipment listed below.": "它包围重要网络站，切断维修人员的支援。小故障变成大中断，远方殖民地只能收到零碎消息。赶走 Zeraveth，技术人员才能回来，重新连接孤立群体。虚构的围攻角色与下方列出的实际战斗装备无关。",
  "Its invented participants endorse one another and create the impression of overwhelming agreement. Small colonies are told their neighbours have already joined the shadow fleet. Yet behind the crowd stands a single hull. Destroying Skorveth exposes the artificial majority and gives the real inhabitants their voices back.": "虚构参与者相互背书，制造压倒性共识。小殖民地被告知邻居已经加入暗影舰队。然而人群背后只有一艘舰体。摧毁 Skorveth，才能揭穿虚假多数，让真实居民重获声音。",
  "Its mission is to subordinate every free node to a single hostile register. Memories need not vanish if nobody can check them independently. Defeating Drazevorn ends that claim. The final victory belongs to participants who can once again compare, disagree and choose trust together.": "它的使命，是让每个自由节点屈从于单一敌对登记册。只要无人能够独立核验，记忆不必消失也能失去意义。击败 Drazevorn，就能终结这一主张。最终胜利属于那些再次能够对照、争论并共同选择信任的参与者。",
  "Keldrava was a mobile transfer point between two distant colonies. When their permanent connection failed, it became their only apparent route to the outside world. Few noticed its crew had changed.": "Keldrava 曾是两个遥远殖民地间的移动转运点。固定连接失效后，它成了看似唯一的对外通路。鲜少有人察觉船员已经换了。",
  "Keldroth was a council vessel where rival colonies settled their final disputes. Its chambers were designed for patience and understanding. Under the shadow fleet they became a factory of deliberately conflicting demands.": "Keldroth 曾是敌对殖民地解决最后争端的议会船，舱室为耐心与理解而设计。暗影舰队却把它变成故意制造矛盾要求的工厂。",
  "Kelvash gathered readings from weather buoys and resource probes. Many stations relied on its reports to make ordinary decisions. Its hostile conversion preserved both its old identifier and familiar broadcast schedule.": "Kelvash 收集气象浮标和资源探测器的读数。许多空间站依靠报告做日常决策。敌对改装后，它仍保留旧标识和熟悉的播报时刻。",
  "Kelzorn restored damaged data reliefs in abandoned research stations. Its tools could make missing surfaces look complete. The new crew applied that skill to the facades of unreliable archives.": "Kelzorn 曾修复废弃科研站中受损的数据浮雕，其工具能让缺失表面看似完整。新船员将这种本领用于粉饰不可靠的档案。",
  "Kezravel registered the settlers of a travelling colony fleet. Its archives held the story of every new beginning. When those settlers dispersed, their trust stayed aboard and fell into hostile hands.": "Kezravel 曾登记流动殖民船队的居民，档案记录着每一次新生活的开始。居民散去后，信任留在船上，最终落入敌方手中。",
  "Korthaven was a vast storage carrier keeping archives accessible across many sectors. Its crew promised every requested copy could be delivered. The shadow fleet discovered the power contained in a refused answer.": "Korthaven 曾是庞大的储存运输舰，让档案在多个星区保持可访问。船员承诺按需提供每份副本。暗影舰队却发现，拒绝答复也蕴藏力量。",
  "Korvessa served a diplomatic courier fleet and learned the recognition signals of every border station. When its patrons disappeared, it kept their identities in a hidden archive.": "Korvessa 曾服务于外交信使舰队，熟知每座边境站的识别信号。支持者消失后，它把他们的身份留在隐秘档案中。",
  "Korzeth was a flying bazaar connecting traders from many worlds. Its windows showed busy commerce even while the harbour slept. Most offers now originate from one concealed command room.": "Korzeth 曾是连接众多世界商人的飞行集市。港口沉睡时，窗口仍展示繁忙交易。如今大多数报价都来自同一间隐秘指挥室。",
  "Neravoss was the glittering exhibition ship of a trade fair. Its projectors once displayed real cargo and new engines. When the fair collapsed, the scenery survived under different owners.": "Neravoss 曾是贸易展会光彩夺目的展示船，投影呈现真实货物和新引擎。展会倒闭后，布景却在新主人手中继续存在。",
  "Nerthavel organised requests for immense supply centres. Its memory could absorb days of backlog. The shadow fleet turned that reserve into somewhere legitimate requests are made to remain.": "Nerthavel 曾为巨大补给中心安排请求，内存可容纳数天积压。暗影舰队却把这份储备变成合法请求永远滞留的地方。",
  "Nethrava carried the insignia of a respected fleet guardian. After that organisation dissolved, it remained its last visible representative. Few imagined that the familiar silhouette now served another cause.": "Nethrava 携带着受尊敬的舰队守护者徽章。组织解散后，它成为最后可见的代表。鲜少有人想到，熟悉的轮廓已在为另一方效力。",
  "Night Guard came from a colony on a tidally locked moon’s dark side. Its harbours knew no sunrise, but recognised returning patrol lights. The shipyard built that promise into a hull: return, check again, forget nobody. Its stories concern fewer grand victories than a single dock kept open for a late freighter.": "Night Guard 来自一颗潮汐锁定卫星暗面的殖民地。港口没有日出，却认得返航巡逻灯。船厂将这份承诺造进舰体：归来，再检查一次，不遗忘任何人。它的故事少有宏大胜利，更多是为晚归货船留着的一个泊位。",
  "Nova Wing was designed for the first voyage beyond the luminous nova rim. Its shipyard shared the plans with distant colonies so nobody would be excluded from safe navigation. Pilots still tell of that first return: a damaged ship, an intact chart archive and a sky full of new possibilities.": "Nova Wing 为首次越过明亮新星边缘的航行而设计。船厂把图纸分享给远方殖民地，让人人都有安全导航的机会。飞行员仍讲述首次返航：受损的飞船、完好的星图档案，以及满天新的可能。",
  "Now cargo disappears between its locks while reassuring receipts promise safe passage. It exploits the trust each community places in the other. Its decks hide the spoils of divided worlds. The defenders must close this false bridge before more colonies send their future through its holds.": "如今货物在它的船闸间消失，令人安心的收据却承诺安全通行。它利用群体彼此的信任，甲板藏着割裂世界的赃物。守卫者必须关闭这座假桥，免得更多殖民地把未来送进它的货舱。",
  "Now each arrival carries a different trusted name. Forged messages lure supply ships away from safe routes and disguise hostile orders as assistance. Behind the courteous callsign waits a warship. Defeating Korvessa reminds the colonies that a familiar voice is not proof of an honest sender.": "如今它每次到达都冒用不同的可信名字。伪造消息将补给船引离安全航路，把敌对命令伪装成援助。礼貌呼号背后是一艘战舰。击败 Korvessa，提醒殖民地：熟悉的声音并不证明发送者诚实。",
  "Now every message and delivery attracts another invented charge. Even rescue crews receive demands while their passage stays blocked. The network is not destroyed but squeezed. Thalverik turns a public connection into a trap. Defeating it returns the route to the communities that depend on it.": "如今每条消息和每次交付都会招来新编造的收费。救援船员也被索费，通路仍然封锁。网络没有被摧毁，却被不断榨取。Thalverik 把公共连接变成陷阱；击败它，才能把路线还给依赖它的群体。",
  "Now it floods trade routes with worthless transactions and endless copies of messages. Distress calls disappear in the noise while genuine deliveries wait for confirmation. Its armoured silhouette guards the source of the interference. Stopping Varneth means restoring a network that can hear its people again.": "如今它以无用交易和无尽消息副本淹没贸易航线。求救信号消失在噪声中，真实交付等待确认。装甲轮廓守护干扰源。阻止 Varneth，才能让网络再次听到居民的声音。",
  "Now its offers of assistance demand confidential clearances. Responders find a watched docking bay instead of safety. Zarnvek uses hope as bait and armour as insurance. The defenders must expose the impostor without teaching isolated colonies to turn away from genuine help.": "如今它以提供援助为名索取机密通行许可。回应者看到的不是安全，而是受监视的泊位。Zarnvek 以希望为诱饵，以装甲为保险。守卫者必须揭穿冒牌者，同时避免让孤立殖民地不再相信真正的帮助。",
  "Odravik specialised in preserving old colony archives. Its enormous storage array promised protection against any disaster. Only when a station requested its records back did anyone discover that many copies were merely directory entries.": "Odravik 曾专门保存旧殖民档案，巨大储存阵列承诺抵御任何灾难。直到有空间站索回记录，大家才发现许多副本仅仅是目录条目。",
  "Olive Fortress was built during an armistice in a neutral shipyard. Former enemies shared tools without forgetting their past. The first hull wore workshop colours instead of a victor’s paint. Its legend concerns boundaries that protect without excluding every encounter: a fortress can also be somewhere negotiations happen safely.": "停战期间，中立船厂建造了 Olive Fortress。昔日敌人共享工具，却不遗忘过去。首艘舰体涂着工坊的颜色，而非胜者的涂装。传说中的边界既提供保护，也不拒绝所有相遇：堡垒同样可以让谈判安全进行。",
  "Orbit Arc served stations whose paths rarely met. Its first pilots carried letters between distant orbits. Replies sometimes took months, but each encounter had a reliable window. Those small appointments grew into a lasting trade network. The design remembers that even infrequent contact matters when people can depend on it.": "Orbit Arc 服务于轨道很少交会的空间站。最早的飞行员在遥远轨道间送信，答复有时需等数月，但每次相遇都有可靠的时间窗口。小小约定逐渐形成持久贸易网络。它提醒人们：只要值得信赖，即使稀少的联系也重要。",
  "Orvask once escorted convoys and preserved every clearance as evidence. Its memory still contains the voices of captains who vanished long ago.": "Orvask 曾护送船队，并保存每份通行许可作为证据。记忆中仍有许多早已失踪船长的声音。",
  "Orvethra was a mobile trade office where colonies arranged long-term supplies. Its advisers promised simple rules for difficult times. Today every convenient agreement leads to obligations previously kept out of view.": "Orvethra 曾是安排长期补给的移动贸易办公室，顾问许诺以简单规则应对艰难时期。如今每份方便的协议，都通向原先隐藏的义务。",
  "Orzhaven mapped connections between aid groups and supply stations. Its charts once made cooperation easier. Those same relationships now identify where a betrayal would cause the greatest harm.": "Orzhaven 曾绘制援助团体与补给站之间的连接图，让合作更容易。如今同样的关系却指出了哪里发生背叛会造成最大伤害。",
  "Othravel was built for colonies trying to agree on common rules after a war. Its conference deck once seated every side. Now it hosts only the messengers of the shadow fleet.": "Othravel 为战后希望共同制定规则的殖民地而建。会议甲板曾容纳各方，如今却只接待暗影舰队的信使。",
  "Outposts work from stale views while selected updates arrive only when they can cause confusion. A common timeline fractures into competing versions of the present. Velkrath guards its archives like hostages. The defenders must end the backlog before delay hardens into lasting division.": "前哨依赖过时信息，特定更新只在能制造混乱时送达。共同时间线裂成相互竞争的现实版本。Velkrath 像看守人质一样守护档案。守卫者必须结束积压，免得延迟凝固成永久分裂。",
  "Pi Vanguard began as a joint project of small pioneer shipyards. None could fund a complete ship alone, but together they supplied materials, time and experience. Its first mission secured an open supply route for every participating colony. In this fictional universe the design represents strength through participation rather than one actor’s control.": "Pi Vanguard 是小型拓荒船厂的联合项目。无人能独资造出整艘飞船，却能共同投入材料、时间和经验。首次任务保障所有参与殖民地的开放补给路线。在这个虚构宇宙中，它代表参与汇聚的力量，而非单方控制。",
  "Raiders captured Verdants hoping to sell valuable seed archives. The archives had already been moved, leaving only ships and disappointed sponsors. New funding for upgrades rarely followed.": "掠夺者俘获 Verdant，企图出售珍贵的种子档案。档案早已转移，留下的只有飞船和失望的资助者。后续升级经费很少再到位。",
  "Red Comet was named after a rescue flight whose glowing trail crossed three colonies’ skies. Its pilot brought no treasure, only the last intact design for a water purifier. Legends embellished the journey, but the shipyard preserves the simple original report: the people at its destination could drink again the next morning.": "Red Comet 得名于一次救援飞行，光芒划过三个殖民地的天空。飞行员没带财宝，只带着最后完好的净水器设计。传说不断润饰旅程，船厂却保留简朴原报告：目的地的人们第二天早晨又喝上了水。",
  "Relay pirates seized several Scouts in a salvage-depot raid. Their meagre proceeds paid for fuel and repairs, leaving almost nothing for upgrades. Pilots now sometimes face hostile vessels from the same modest family.": "中继海盗袭击打捞仓库，夺走了数艘 Scout。微薄收益只够燃料和维修，几乎没有升级余款。飞行员如今有时会遭遇同属这朴素系列的敌舰。",
  "Rhazkora was a flying accident laboratory. Its records helped crews understand failures and avoid new losses. After its capture the instruments remained, but their reports served different patrons.": "Rhazkora 曾是飞行事故实验室，记录帮助船员理解故障，避免新损失。被俘后，仪器依旧，报告却开始为不同的支持者服务。",
  "Rhazvorn began as a prison transport with independently sealed cells. The shadow fleet removed its prisoners and filled those chambers with captured archives. A detention vessel became an extortion ship.": "Rhazvorn 起初是囚犯运输舰，牢房独立封闭。暗影舰队移走囚犯，将被盗档案装入舱室。拘禁船就此变成勒索舰。",
  "Ring Flare was tested among a gas giant’s icy rings. Its navigation lights became moving meeting points for scattered research teams. When the expedition ended, the signals connected newly founded outposts. Their inhabitants still remember how separate lights formed a shared route before any official chart existed.": "Ring Flare 在气态巨星的冰环间接受测试，导航灯成为分散科研团队的移动会合点。探险结束后，信号连接了新建前哨。居民仍记得，官方星图出现前，一盏盏灯已组成共同航路。",
  "Shifted timestamps make timely messages look late and maintenance windows drift apart. Its threat is not noise but credible inaccuracy. Stopping Irdavoss allows the colonies to compare independent clocks again, restoring the shared sequence that helps them understand what actually happened.": "被挪动的时间戳让及时消息显得迟到，也让维护窗口错开。威胁并非噪声，而是看似可信的错误。阻止 Irdavoss，殖民地才能再次对照独立时钟，恢复理解真实事件所需的共同顺序。",
  "Skorveth housed the simulation cores of a pilot academy. Thousands of artificial cadets once learned to navigate together. After a hostile takeover, those training identities became supposedly independent voices.": "Skorveth 曾装载飞行学院的模拟核心，数千人工学员在其中学习协同导航。遭敌方接管后，这些训练身份成了所谓独立的声音。",
  "Sky Breaker was the first ship from an isolated colony to cross its manufactured information horizon. Its returning reports contradicted stories used to frighten the inhabitants. The shipyard released every mission record. The design remembers that an open connection can matter more than any answer permitted by a single authority.": "Sky Breaker 是第一艘越过隔绝殖民地人为信息边界的飞船。返航报告推翻了用来恐吓居民的故事，船厂公开了全部任务记录。它提醒人们，开放的连接可能比单一权威准许的任何答案都重要。",
  "Smugglers sold missing Orbit Arcs to a hostile border formation. Long supply routes consumed its treasury, leaving money for modern systems only on rare occasions.": "走私者把失踪的 Orbit Arc 卖给敌对边境编队。漫长补给线耗空财政，只有极少时候能添置现代系统。",
  "Solar Lance came from a station drawing energy from a dying star. When its final collector ring was evacuated, these ships escorted rescue freighters through the debris. Their long silhouettes were engraved on the new home port’s memorials. The design stands for holding a clear course while an entire world fades behind it.": "Solar Lance 来自从衰亡恒星汲取能源的空间站。最后的采集环撤离时，它们护送救援货船穿过残骸。细长轮廓刻在新母港的纪念碑上，象征身后整个世界渐渐熄灭时仍坚持清晰航向。",
  "Some messages arrive changed; others disappear between reassuring acknowledgements. Participants see a bridge where there is really a gatekeeper. Dravosk defends that invisible checkpoint with visible force. Its defeat gives the colonies a chance to check their connections along independent routes again.": "有些消息被修改，有些在令人安心的确认之间消失。参与者以为面对桥梁，实际却是守门人。Dravosk 用有形武力守护无形关卡。击败它，殖民地才能再次通过独立路径核验连接。",
  "Storm Wing was built during a season of relentless ion storms. Shipyards worked between blackouts and exchanged progress through couriers. No single site held the complete design until the first ship brought every part together. Its origin tells of a network continuing to work despite repeatedly losing its connections.": "Storm Wing 建造于无休止的离子风暴季。船厂趁停电间隙施工，通过信使交换进展。首艘飞船汇齐全部部件前，没有任何一处掌握完整设计。它的起源讲述着不断失联却仍持续工作的网络。",
  "Striker followed a series of attacks on repair convoys. Its designers wanted no conqueror, but an escort that could buy a threatened workshop time. The first unit consisted of former mechanics. They knew what every minute meant when a damaged engine could not yet start. That origin matters more than the martial name.": "维修船队接连遇袭后，Striker 应运而生。设计者要的不是征服者，而是为受威胁工坊争取时间的护卫。首支队伍由前机械师组成，他们知道损坏引擎尚无法启动时，每一分钟意味着什么。这一起源比好战的名字更重要。",
  "Talvrek recorded the history of young colonies. Its archives survived a war, but loyalty to their creators did not. A new commander turned the chronicler into a merchant of invented history.": "Talvrek 曾记录年轻殖民地的历史。档案熬过战争，对创造者的忠诚却未能保全。新指挥官把编年史家变成了出售虚构历史的商人。",
  "Thalverik guarded a narrow passage through the crystal belt. Its modest navigation fee once paid for real protection. When the official fleet withdrew, the ship declared itself the only authority.": "Thalverik 曾守护晶体带中的狭窄通道，适度的航行费原本支付真正的保护。正规舰队撤离后，它宣称自己是唯一权威。",
  "Thalzek once gathered broken work drones and returned them to their stations. Even the smallest machine could shelter beneath its wide hull. After its conversion, collected drones stopped coming home.": "Thalzek 曾收集损坏的工作无人机，将其送回空间站。最小的机器也能在宽大舰体下找到庇护。改装后，被收集的无人机不再归来。",
  "The Advanced edition escorts threatened archivists along escape routes. Its mission reports are opened only after safe arrival.": "高级型号护送受威胁的档案员沿逃生路线撤离，任务报告只在安全抵达后公开。",
  "The Advanced squadron escorts maintenance buoys along the storm frontier, closing gaps between isolated stations.": "高级中队护送维护浮标穿越风暴边界，弥合孤立空间站之间的连接缺口。",
  "The Advanced squadron was assigned to recover messages from contested relay zones. Its pilots kept the callsigns of the original search teams.": "高级中队负责从争夺中的中继区域找回消息，飞行员保留了最初搜寻队的呼号。",
  "The Advanced watch escorts mobile repair docks. Its crews know every emergency shelter around the harbour ring.": "高级巡逻队护送移动维修船坞，船员熟悉港环周围每处应急避难所。",
  "The Advanced watch keeps the relocated colonies supplied. Every ship carries an old evacuation code.": "高级巡逻队保障迁移殖民地的补给，每艘船都带着旧日疏散代码。",
  "The Archive Arsonist": "档案纵火者",
  "The Audit Diverter": "审计误导者",
  "The Availability Breaker": "可用性破坏者",
  "The Balance Illusionist": "余额幻术师",
  "The Ballot Gatekeeper": "投票守门人",
  "The Block Withholder": "区块扣押者",
  "The Border Blocker": "边境封锁者",
  "The Checksum Painter": "校验伪饰者",
  "The Chronicle Forger": "史册伪造者",
  "The Clock Twister": "时钟扭曲者",
  "The Confirmation Thief": "确认窃贼",
  "The Consensus Besieger": "共识围攻者",
  "The Contract Trap": "契约陷阱",
  "The Copy Prince": "复制王子",
  "The Dust Scatterer": "尘埃散播者",
  "The Echo Hunter": "回声猎手",
  "The Elite edition escorts a threatened sector’s last surviving connection. Its archive symbolically carries the names of every missing courier.": "精英型号护送受威胁星区最后幸存的连接，其档案象征性地记载所有失踪信使的姓名。",
  "The Elite edition escorts final deliveries to besieged colonies. Its callsign remains active until the recipient answers.": "精英型号护送最后一批物资前往被围困殖民地，直到接收者回应，呼号才停止。",
  "The Elite edition guards shared memory after the final boss battle. Its most valuable cargo is the ability to verify history independently.": "精英型号在最终首领战后守护共同记忆，最珍贵的货物是独立核验历史的能力。",
  "The Elite expedition hunts the sources of falsified star charts, inheriting the purpose of the original exploration mission.": "精英探险队追查伪造星图的源头，继承最初探索任务的宗旨。",
  "The Elite expedition investigates systematic map tampering, gathering evidence where others see only conflicting directions.": "精英探险队调查系统性的地图篡改，在他人只见矛盾方向之处收集证据。",
  "The Elite expedition reconnects lost colonies. Its arrival offers opportunities to compare rather than fresh commands.": "精英探险队重新连接失联殖民地，带来相互对照的机会，而非新的命令。",
  "The Elite fleet protects major supply-chain archives. Its emblem represents traceable provenance rather than valuable spoils.": "精英舰队保护大型供应链档案，徽章代表可追溯的来源，而非珍贵战利品。",
  "The Elite formation protects agreements between formerly hostile sectors. Its mission ends only when both sides arrive safely.": "精英编队守护昔日敌对星区之间的协议，直到双方安全抵达，任务才结束。",
  "The Elite formation protects free nodes from Drazevorn’s claim to sole truth. Its story remains fiction and confers no real network function.": "精英编队保护自由节点，抵抗 Drazevorn 垄断真相的主张。故事纯属虚构，不赋予任何真实网络功能。",
  "The Elite guard keeps the last refuge harbours open. It leaves a station only after the final evacuation.": "精英护卫队让最后的避难港保持开放，只有最终疏散完成后才离开空间站。",
  "The Elite guard protects the last complete seed register, including for colonies that have yet to grow their first garden.": "精英护卫队守护最后一份完整种子名录，也为尚未种出第一座花园的殖民地保留希望。",
  "The Elite league guards the sector’s vital rescue convoys. Its most prized title is a crew brought home complete.": "精英联盟守护星区关键救援船队，最珍视的荣誉是让全体船员平安归来。",
  "The Elite refit strengthens the twin laser and raises protection to two enemy projectile hits per life, developing the Advanced edition for this more demanding assignment.": "精英改装强化双联激光，把每条生命的弹丸防护提升到两次，以高级型号为基础，应对更艰巨的任务。",
  "The Elite watch defends neutral archives from capture. Its duty protects shared evidence even against the wishes of its own allies.": "精英巡逻队保护中立档案免遭夺取，即使违背己方盟友意愿，也守护共同证据。",
  "The Emergency Usurper": "危机篡权者",
  "The Empty Backup Merchant": "空备份商人",
  "The Evidence Twister": "证据扭曲者",
  "The False Custodian": "虚假保管者",
  "The False Rescuer": "伪装救援者",
  "The Final Isolator": "最终孤立者",
  "The Fog Judge": "迷雾裁判",
  "The Fork Lord": "分叉领主",
  "The Grey Scout emerged from a workshop surviving on salvaged parts after the outer relays failed. Its first pilots searched for missing courier buoys rather than battles. Every recovered memory linked a family to its colony again. The modest hull became a reminder that a network can recover through small, persistent acts.": "外层中继失效后，一家靠回收零件维生的工坊造出了灰色侦察机。最早的飞行员寻找失踪信使浮标，而非投身战斗。每份找回的记忆都让一家人与殖民地重新连接。朴素舰体提醒人们：微小而持久的行动，也能让网络复原。",
  "The Identity Auctioneer": "身份拍卖者",
  "The Key Gaoler": "密钥狱卒",
  "The Lord of False Truth": "伪真相之主",
  "The Many-Faced": "千面者",
  "The Mask Bearer": "面具持有者",
  "The Memory Emptier": "记忆掏空者",
  "The Memory Hunter": "记忆猎手",
  "The Mirror Market": "镜像市场",
  "The Node Besieger": "节点围攻者",
  "The Oracle Deceiver": "预言机欺骗者",
  "The Origin Eraser": "来源抹除者",
  "The Queue Devourer": "队列吞噬者",
  "The Queue Raider": "队列劫掠者",
  "The Recovery Impostor": "恢复冒牌者",
  "The Relay Illusionist": "中继幻术师",
  "The Route Poisoner": "航路投毒者",
  "The Rumour Carrier": "谣言运输者",
  "The Seal Thief": "印章窃贼",
  "The Shadow Bridge": "暗影之桥",
  "The shadow fleet turned those recordings into an arsenal of old commands. Orvask rebroadcasts them as current instructions, trapping stations between genuine present needs and familiar echoes. It guards that archive with patient violence. Its defeat gives the defenders time to reject expired orders and restore the value of fresh confirmation.": "暗影舰队把那些录音变成旧命令的武器库。Orvask 将其重新广播为当前指令，让空间站困在现实需求与熟悉回声之间。它以耐心的暴力守护档案。击败它，守卫者才能拒绝过期命令，恢复重新确认的意义。",
  "The Silence Filter": "静默过滤者",
  "The Spam Broadcaster": "垃圾消息广播者",
  "The Supply-Chain Worm": "供应链蠕虫",
  "The Swarm Collector": "蜂群收集者",
  "The Toll Tyrant": "通行费暴君",
  "The Trust Cartographer": "信任制图师",
  "The Vault Promiser": "金库许诺者",
  "Thervoss guarded the receiving stations of interstellar deliveries. Its lights once told captains their cargo had arrived safely. Today they shine even when nobody waits behind the dock doors.": "Thervoss 曾守护星际交付的接收站，灯光告知船长货物已安全抵达。如今，即使码头门后无人等待，灯仍亮着。",
  "This hull family is used by BOTH players and enemy fleets. Its silhouette does not identify allegiance; enemy stats depend on their own class and level.": "玩家与敌方舰队都会使用这一舰体系列。轮廓不能判断阵营；敌机属性由各自类型和等级决定。",
  "Threvask coordinated independent inspection ships and assigned safe approaches. Its situation maps were famous for precision. After its capture those same inspectors were directed toward carefully prepared displays.": "Threvask 曾协调独立检查船，安排安全接近路线，态势图以精确闻名。被俘后，同一批检查员却被引向精心布置的展示。",
  "Today it labels essential evidence as unnecessary clutter. After a visit, supply histories, ownership records and traces of earlier attacks are missing. Nobody immediately knows how wide the gaps are. Valdrek carries the tools of a useful task as weapons. Stopping it prevents more losses that arrive without an explosion.": "如今它把关键证据称为无用杂物。造访后，补给历史、所有权记录和旧袭击痕迹消失，没人立即知道缺口有多大。Valdrek 把有益工作的工具变成武器。阻止它，才能避免更多没有爆炸却真实发生的损失。",
  "Today it reports imaginary stocks and false environmental conditions. Automated processes move real resources in response to an invented world. Kelvash protects the source of these lies. The defenders must silence it before more lives depend on measurements that were never taken.": "如今它报告虚构库存和虚假环境条件，自动流程依照编造的世界调动真实资源。Kelvash 守护谎言源头。守卫者必须让它停止，免得更多生命依赖从未实际测量的读数。",
  "Twin Core was built by two shipyards divided by an old conflict. Each supplied part of the design and insisted on independent inspection. Only when their reports agreed did the joint maiden flight begin. The model symbolises trust grown through patient mutual verification rather than demanded on authority.": "Twin Core 由因旧争端分裂的两家船厂共同建造。双方各提供部分设计，并坚持独立检验。只有报告一致后，联合首航才开始。它象征耐心的相互核验所建立的信任，而非权威强求的信任。",
  "Valdrek maintained overcrowded archives. It once removed only confirmed duplicates and kept meticulous logs. The shadow fleet erased those logs first, then changed the mission.": "Valdrek 曾维护拥挤的档案库，只删除确认重复的内容，并留下细致日志。暗影舰队先抹去日志，再改变任务。",
  "Varneth once carried supply records between the Genesis colonies. It vanished behind an abandoned relay and returned without a crew signature, its cargo holds converted into transmission chambers.": "Varneth 曾在起源殖民地之间运送补给记录。它消失于废弃中继站背后，归来时没有船员签名，货舱已改成发射舱。",
  "Varnokh once removed interference from the crowded radio channels of busy ports. Its filters helped distress calls stand out. The shadow fleet changed just one list: which voices counted as interference.": "Varnokh 曾清理繁忙港口拥挤无线电频道中的干扰，让求救声清晰可辨。暗影舰队只改了一份名单：哪些声音算作干扰。",
  "Vashravel held emergency reserves for several border colonies. Its name meant supplies that would remain available through the worst winter. A new administration issued more and more claims on the same stores.": "Vashravel 曾为多个边境殖民地保管应急储备，名字意味着即使最严酷的冬天也有物资可用。新管理者却对同一批库存发出了越来越多索取权。",
  "Vector arose from a navigators’ dispute: trust one perfect course, or compare independent measurements? The second group built this ship and crossed an uncharted debris ring. Their return became a case for cooperation. Its surviving charts preserve the conflicting readings so later pilots can understand how the shared route was found.": "Vector 源于领航员的争论：相信一条完美航线，还是对照独立测量？后者造出这艘船，穿过未测绘的碎片环，返航证明合作的价值。留存星图保留相互冲突的读数，让后来的飞行员理解共同航路如何找到。",
  "Velkrath led a research convoy carrying new ledger blocks over immense distances. Its sealed containers preserved every record unchanged. Its current commander uses those same containers to withhold information deliberately.": "Velkrath 曾带领科研船队，跨越漫长距离运送新的账本区块。密封容器让每份记录原样保存。现任指挥官却用同样的容器故意扣留信息。",
  "Velzhar carried sealed votes between distant council stations. Its neutral route was part of every agreement. Now it reaches selected harbours on time and others only after decisions are finished.": "Velzhar 曾在遥远议会站之间运输封存选票，中立路线是每份协议的一部分。如今它准时抵达特定港口，其他港口却要等到决定已作出。",
  "Verdant carried the first seed archives to a colony without natural soil. Its plans travelled alongside plant catalogues so other settlements could become independent. Its pilots consider themselves guardians of future harvests. An intact archive can matter more than glittering cargo: it may contain a whole winter’s food supply.": "Verdant 把首批种子档案送到没有天然土壤的殖民地。图纸与植物目录共同传播，让其他定居点能够自给自足。飞行员视自己为未来收成的守护者。完整档案可能比闪亮货物更重要，其中也许藏着整个冬天的食物。",
  "Veshkorn once brought news to the remotest outposts. Its archives still contain the welcoming fanfares of peaceful broadcasts. Today those sounds announce invented disasters and impending collapses.": "Veshkorn 曾把新闻送到最偏远的前哨，档案仍保存和平广播的迎宾乐声。如今那些声音宣告的却是虚构灾难和迫近的崩溃。",
  "Vezrakh was built to assist when central command stations failed. Its emergency mandate allowed rapid action in chaotic hours. The shadow fleet taught it to declare those exceptional circumstances itself.": "Vezrakh 为中央指挥站失效时提供援助而造，应急授权让它能在混乱中迅速行动。暗影舰队却教会它自行宣布这种特殊状态。",
  "Vorathen managed the arrival queues of an enormous trade port. Its command deck could order thousands of approaches without overlooking a ship. When the port fell, it carried those scheduling archives away.": "Vorathen 曾管理庞大贸易港的进场队列，指挥甲板能安排数千次接近，不遗漏一艘船。港口陷落后，它带走了调度档案。",
  "Vorthaz defended a refuge seeking outside contact after a long war. Its task was to keep dangerous connections away. The shadow fleet twisted that duty until every unfamiliar voice counted as a threat.": "Vorthaz 曾守护一处战后寻求对外联系的避难所，负责隔绝危险连接。暗影舰队扭曲了这项职责，让每个陌生声音都成了威胁。",
  "Warnings from honest inspectors now vanish alongside reports of hostile raids. The sector appears peaceful because its problems cannot be heard. Varnokh guards this manufactured silence. Stopping it lets the network recognise its own failures again and begin repairing them together.": "诚实检查员的警告如今与敌方袭击报告一同消失。星区看似和平，只因问题无法被听见。Varnokh 守护人为的沉默。阻止它，网络才能重新认识自身故障，并开始共同修复。",
  "When an outpost lost its research budget, a rigged auction placed Ring Flares in enemy hands. The buyers exhausted their funds acquiring them. Few were improved beyond their basic specification.": "前哨失去研究经费后，一场被操纵的拍卖让 Ring Flare 落入敌方手中。买家将资金耗尽在购买上，鲜少能改进基础配置。",
  "Zarnvek was a rescue ship recognised by its golden signal flare. Its arrival meant spare parts, shelter and a way home. The hostile fleet captured the flare along with the vessel.": "Zarnvek 曾是以金色信号焰闻名的救援船。它的到来意味着备件、庇护和回家的路。敌对舰队连同船只一起夺走了信号焰。",
  "Zelkharn repaired freighters far from established shipyards. Its spare parts were trusted and installed with little hesitation. After its capture, the source of those components changed before their behaviour did.": "Zelkharn 曾在远离正规船厂的地方修理货船。备件深受信任，安装时少有人迟疑。被俘后，组件来源先改变了，其性能变化却迟迟才显露。",
  "Zeraveth began as a repair platform able to embrace entire relay rings. Under the shadow fleet, its docking structures became positions for a siege.": "Zeraveth 起初是能环抱整个中继环的维修平台。暗影舰队却把对接结构变成了围攻阵地。",
  "Zhavrek preserved provenance records for the oldest colony ships. Even forgotten shipyards could be found through its archives. Today it exchanges origins and makes stolen goods appear legitimately acquired.": "Zhavrek 曾保存最古老殖民船的来源记录，档案甚至能找出早已被遗忘的船厂。如今它调换来历，让赃物看似合法取得。",
  "Zorveth supervised exchanges between two independent registers. Its task was to make honest transfers traceable on both sides. It now recognises only the evidence useful to its own fleet.": "Zorveth 曾监督两个独立登记册之间的交换，让诚实转移在双方都可追溯。如今它只承认对自身舰队有利的证据。"
};
